  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_brownb",
      "name": {
        "en": "Beehunter's Badge",
        "zh": "猎蜂证章",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_brownb",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Beehunter has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for asserting the advantage in close-quarters combat.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Guard Operator during field operations to exercise Fighter responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员猎蜂擅长在近身格斗中取得优势\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为近卫干员，行使斗士职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_brownb",
      "name": {
        "en": "Strong Jaw",
        "zh": "咬紧牙关",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_brownb",
      "description": {
        "en": "'And a left, and a right! With a boxing style both fast and weighty... wh-where did this Ursine come from?!\n'I can't believe it! A third fighter has crashed the sacred ring! And she's catching every hook the Twinzerker Beasts throw at her!\n'What? ...You're taking me in for questioning? You suspect our underground arena of concealing and reselling your drugs?\n'No, let me finish commentating this match first! This is freedom, passion, one against many, the weak against the strong! THIS IS THE TRUE FACE OF THE UNDERGROUND RING!'\nA few Rhodes Island operators haul the commentator off, parrying the bottles and worn boxing gloves lobbed by the rowdy spectators, before a group of fiendish thugs blocks their path. Not that the ops want to escalate this any further, but the ringside is in chaos by now.\nThey're about to put on Shura's mouthguards and personally get to know the rules of the underground arena, but the mince-no-words Ursine opts to leap down from the ring and stop them.\n'I'll deal with 'em! Underground fight rules are MY rules!'\nIn Shura's memory, this is where she grew up, right here on the shabby stage under the sickly lights, under the cheers and jeers as the ref sounded the bell. Here, she faced opponents far stronger than her, matches called to screw her over. Here, she faced all that she couldn't see through and couldn't take down, and it didn't take long for her to learn to grin and bear it. Go down? Get up again. Keep throwing your fists. Use all your strength. Show 'em how done dirty you feel, deep inside. Free the rebel in your blood.\nOnce Shura comes back to reality, her fellow ops are bracing her. They're already leaving the underground arena. Once again, she took on a million to one. Once again, she won enough time for her friends to get back what was theirs. She hears them discuss a celebratory dinner tonight, floating the idea of ordering her a tub of honey so deep she'll never finish chugging. Finally, the corners of her mouth pull up in a punch-drunk smile, tortured muscles screaming with delayed-onset but oh so true pain.\n'Shura... you're pretty freaking beat up. Maybe we get a medic to treat you first?'\n'Oof... eaargh, I'll shake it off!'\nThe moment she loosens her jaw, her mouthguards drop right out. With a massive start, the gang realizes she's already chewed the damn things to pieces.",
        "zh": "“左一拳，右一拳！这拳风又快又重……这、这个乌萨斯是从哪里跳出来的？！\n“真没想到！神圣的擂台之上突然闯入了第三个人，而她竟然接住了那两个‘狂暴野兽’的每一记重拳！\n“啊？……要把我带去调查？我们的地下擂台涉嫌窝藏、倒卖你们的药品？\n“不，让我解说完这场比赛！自由、激烈、以一敌多、以弱御强！这才是地下擂台赛该有的样子！”\n几个罗德岛干员架着解说员，刚挡下好事观众丢过来的酒瓶与烂拳套，又有一群凶神恶煞的打手拦在他们面前。干员们本不想把事态扩大，但观赛席已经乱作一团。\n干员们正要戴上舒拉为他们准备的保护牙套，亲身来会一会地下拳场的规矩，而那个一向直来直往的乌萨斯却从擂台上跳下来，挡在了干员们的身前。\n“我来对付他们！地下拳场的规矩我熟！”\n在舒拉的记忆里，她就是在破旧擂台的昏黄灯光下、裁判钟响时的欢呼与嘘声中长大的。面对比自己强大得多的对手，面对不公平的比赛判决，面对那些她看不惯又打不赢的一切，舒拉很早就学会了咬紧牙关。倒下，再爬起来，然后继续用尽全力去挥拳，去表达心底里的不服气，去释放血液中的叛逆。\n等舒拉再回过神来时，她已经被干员们搀扶着离开了地下拳场。面对众多敌人，舒拉又一次为她的朋友们争取了足够多的时间，拿回了他们的东西。听到干员们商量着要在晚上的庆功宴上给她点一桶怎么喝都喝不完的蜂蜜，舒拉才痴痴地咧起嘴，牵动的肌肉终于让她感受到了迟来的真实的疼痛。\n“舒拉……你伤得挺重的，还是先让医疗干员帮你处理一下吧？”\n“唔……唔哇，没什么大不了的！”\n舒拉一张口，保护牙套便从她嘴里掉了出来。大家惊讶地发现，原来这个牙套已经被舒拉咬烂了。",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
